    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ん？　なんだい君たち？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm? Who are all of you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んー、えと……
あんた、ヒリップさん？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm, uh...
Are you Phillip?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたち、ギスキーさんの
紹介で……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mr. Tolliver sent us...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほほう、ギスキー氏の。
じゃあ君らが
協力してくれるのかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oho, Mr. Tolliver, you say?
Then you're willing to work
for me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>協力？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Work for you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう。実はね、一度
闘技場のチャンピオンを
見てみたいんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, you see. I was hoping
I could see a real Arena
Champion, just once.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この前友達と口論になってね。
パワー重視のムキムキマッチョが
一番強いのか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I had a bit of a debate with a friend
of mine. Are powerful, muscle-bound
macho men stronger, or...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それともスピード重視の
スマートタイプが強いのか？
さらにそれとも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe the clever,
speedy type of fighter?
Or perhaps even...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バランスタイプが強いのか？
でもこれは器用貧乏そうだしなぁ。
その答えを見たいのさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Someone with a good balance of both?
But a jack of all trades is a master of
none, right? So, I need a real answer.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ようするに
闘技場で優勝して来い、
ってことなのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So basically, you want
us to win at the Arena
and then come back?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうかな？
チャンピオン、
なってくれるかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How about it?
Will you become a
Champion for me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ギスキーさんの紹介なら、
君たち、強いんだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If Mr. Tolliver sent you, you
must be pretty strong, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんかウサギとはまったく
関係ないみたいだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Looks like this doesn't have
anything to do with rabbits, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これもなりきり士の仕事、
ということなら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But if we just think of it
as roleplayer work...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わかった！　じゃあ
チャンピオンになったら
また来るよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, got it! Then we'll come
back once one of us is Champ!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>助かるよ。
フフフ……これで
ヒリップ強まり計画が始動できる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're a big help. Hehehe...
With this, Phillip's Strength
Training Plan is finally in motion...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、まぁ、あまり気にせずに
行きましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-Well, let's try not to
overthink it. Let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
